    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.git\n\n### Description\n\nHi @echasnovski! Do you think something like https://github.com/akinsho/git-conflict.nvim is suited to be part of mini.git module?\r\nBasically this plugin offers functionality to resolve merge conflicts and highlight them in a buffer properly.",
